<title>FRANCE: One flour ship expected in Rouen by December 11.</title>
<headline>One flour ship expected in Rouen by December 11.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship is expected in Rouen by December 11 to load some 2,700 tonnes of flour, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The destination for the flour was not specified, they said.</p>
<p>In Rouen two ships were currently loading 30,000 tonnes of flour destined for West Africa and Yemen.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
